      <div><a class="wordmark" href="#overview">TurboJ<span class="brand-cursor" aria-hidden="true"></span></a><p>The ultra-fast Java editor.</p><p class="footer-sequence">Edit. Compile. Run. Repeat.</p></div>
      <nav aria-label="Footer navigation">{site.navigation.map(({ label, href }) => <a href={href}>{label}</a>)}<a href={site.links.source}>GitHub</a></nav>
    </div>
    <div class="footer-bottom"><p>© 2026 TurboJ. An independent software project.</p><p>Not affiliated with Borland or its successors.</p></div>
  </div>
</footer>
